# The above patterns are meant for accidentally generated build/debug
# output, but they also match the JVM regression suite's vendored Lua
# fixtures (scripts, expected output, and the upstream test archive).
# Keep those tracked so :luak-jvm:test is reproducible in CI.
!luak-jvm/src/test/resources/**

